Acceptance criteria
-------------------
Root/subpath pages resolve the SVG favicon from the static build.
Actual raster has transparent corners and the wide handheld silhouette at tab sizes.
All banner frames have transparent canvas and still animate; no purple matte.
The existing boot-demo clip remains separate and unchanged.
No application lifecycle, startup motion, runtime, ROM or save behavior changes.

